website quality on customer loyalty.', null, '[{"id":"a","text":"The proposal has too few hypotheses"},{"id":"b","text":"The aim, objectives and hypotheses address different phenomena, so the study is misaligned"},{"id":"c","text":"E-commerce cannot be studied quantitatively"},{"id":"d","text":"Website quality is not a valid construct"}]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::text[], '[]'::jsonb, 'ai_practice', true)
